BY021 [*] `@property` can be written as `let area` with accessors
 --> BY021.by:6:5
  |
5 |       # a computed property: one getter, nothing else
6 | /     @property
7 | |     def area(self) -> int:
8 | |         return self.w * self.h
  | |______________________________^
help: Replace with a `let area` declaration
  |
5 |     # a computed property: one getter, nothing else
  -     @property
  -     def area(self) -> int:
  -         return self.w * self.h
6 +     let area: int
7 +         get() = self.w * self.h
8 |
